    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>mariner's compass (OED s.v. compass n.1) | an instrument for taking measurements and describing circles, consisting (in its simplest form) of two straight and equal legs connected at one end by a movable joint (OED s.v. compass n.1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
